   "id": "pmt/pure-core-2/ch8/q10",
   "question": "<p>Two compounds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Y\"></span>, are involved in a chemical reaction. The amounts in grams of these compounds, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> minutes after the reaction starts, are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span> respectively and are modelled by the differential equations</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\mathrm dx}{\\mathrm dt}&amp;=-5x+10y-30\\\\\\frac{\\mathrm dy}{\\mathrm dt}&amp;=-2x+3y-4\\end{aligned}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li><p>Show that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\mathrm d^2x}{\\mathrm dt^2}+2\\frac{\\mathrm dx}{\\mathrm dt}+5x=50\" data-display=\"true\"></div><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li><li>Find, according to the model, a general solution for the amount in grams of compound <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"X\"></span> present at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> minutes. <span class=\"marks\">(6)</span></li><li>Find, according to the model, a general solution for the amount in grams of compound <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Y\"></span> present at time <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t\"></span> minutes. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=5\"></span> when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"t=0\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"4\"><li>find<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li>the particular solution for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\"></span>,</li><li>the particular solution for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y\"></span>.</li></ol><span class=\"marks\">(4)</span></li></ol><p>A scientist thinks that the chemical reaction will have stopped after 8 minutes.</p><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\" start=\"5\"><li>Explain whether this is supported by the model. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li></ol>",
